+	/**
+	 * A glow around glyphs at Origin, posed as they are: copies in its color, in rings around them out to Radius, each
+	 * ring fainter than the one inside it and each copy faint enough that where a ring's copies all overlap - the
+	 * letter's own shape - it is as strong as that ring is meant to be. So the glow is strongest hugging the letter and
+	 * fades out toward Radius. Drawn before the letter, on the layer under it.
